    'type_section' => 'texte',
    'titre_section' => 'Research & Innovation',
    'sous_titre' => '',
    'contenu_texte' => '<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt;">At African Green Farmers Limited, research and innovation constitute the scientific backbone of our vertically integrated model&mdash;from sustainable cultivation of medicinal plants and functional crops to the development of standardized TCAMs, Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements, clean-label fortified health food products and fruit beverages, preclinical research-based phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals, clinically validated phytopharmaceutical products for domestic, regional and international markets. Our research strategy integrates ethnobotanical intelligence, modern pharmacognosy, phytochemistry, molecular biology, biotechnology and translational preclinical sciences to transform indigenous bioresources into evidence-based, regulatory-compliant health products.</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="font-size: 14pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;" align="left"><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">1.</strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Integrated Research Architecture </strong></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;" align="left"><span style="font-size: 14pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;" align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 36.0pt;" align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(22, 145, 121); background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);"><strong><span style="font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(241, 196, 15);"><span style="background-color: rgb(236, 240, 241);">Our innovation ecosystem is structured across five technical pillars</span>:</span></strong></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">A. Ethnobotanical Intelligence &amp; Biodiversity Valorization</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">We systematically document, validate and prioritize medicinal plant species using evidencebased screening criteria, focusing on high-burden diseases, metabolic disorders, immune health and preventive nutrition. This ensures both scientific relevance and strong market viability.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">B. Phytochemical Standardization &amp; Molecular Profiling</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Using advanced analytical platforms (UHPLC-MS/MS<span style="color: red;">, </span>GC-MS/MS 8000<span style="color: red;">, </span>HPAAS<span style="color: red;">, </span>AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR, and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer), we:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Identify active marker compounds</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Establish quantitative phytochemical fingerprints</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ensure batch-to-batch reproducibility</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop standardized extracts meeting international pharmacopeial thresholds</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">This scientific rigor differentiates our products from traditional herbal preparations and positions them as standardized phytopharmaceutical-grade formulations.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">C. Bioprocessing &amp; Bio-enhancement Technologies</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">We apply controlled fermentation systems, microbial biotechnology (including selected LAB strains where applicable), and green extraction technologies to:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Increase bioavailability</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Enhance active compound concentration</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Improve stability and shelf life</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Optimize pharmacodynamic performance</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">D. Preclinical &amp; Translational Research</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Through our planned laboratory animal research platform, we conduct:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Toxicological profiling</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic studies</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Dose optimization</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Mechanism-of-action validation</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">This bridges traditional knowledge with evidence-based medicine and supports regulatory approval pathways.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">E. Product Development &amp; Regulatory Alignment</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">We design formulations aligned with:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->WHO Traditional Medicine Strategy</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->African Medicines Agency harmonization frameworks</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->International GMP standards</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ESG and sustainability compliance benchmarks</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Each product progresses through defined Technology Readiness Levels (TRLs), ensuring clear de-risking milestones for investors.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">F. Research-to-Market Pipeline</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; margin: 0cm 180.7pt .85pt 17.25pt;">Our innovation pipeline follows a structured 7-stage model: <span style="font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;">&sect;</span><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Biodiversity mapping &amp; species selection</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Phytochemical screening &amp; active compound validation</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Standardized extract development</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preclinical safety &amp; efficacy studies</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pilot-scale GMP production</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regulatory dossier preparation</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Commercial scale-up &amp; market deployment</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">This pipeline reduces technical uncertainty, accelerates time-to-market, and protects investor capital through phased risk mitigation.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">G. Innovation with Measurable Outcomes <span style="font-weight: normal;">(2031 Targets) </span></h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">By 2031, AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES will have:</p>
