<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Achieved international-quality certifications</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Generated validated clinical data supporting global commercialization</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Positioned as a regional hub for evidence-based phytomedicine innovation</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">H. ESG-Driven Scientific Innovation</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Our research platform is built on:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Sustainable raw material sourcing</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Climate-smart organic cultivation</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Zero-waste bioprocessing</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Community-inclusive value chains</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Gender-inclusive scientific workforce development</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Scientific excellence and sustainability are not parallel strategies&mdash;they are integrated drivers of long-term value creation.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">I.<span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Sustainability &amp; Long-Term Value Creation</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; tab-stops: 408.5pt;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-tab-count: 1;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>
