    'titre_section' => 'Market & Industry Outlook',
    'sous_titre' => 'Market & Industry Outlook',
    'contenu_texte' => '<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 18.0pt;" align="left"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Domestic Market Viability: </strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; line-height: 102%; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .2pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 102%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Growing non-communicable disease prevalence and increasing consumer awareness of preventive healthcare are driving demand for nutraceuticals, fortified functional foods, and phytomedicines. Localized production supports affordability and import substitution.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span><span style="mso-tab-count: 1;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 18.0pt;" align="left"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Regional Market Opportunity: </strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->COMESA, EAC and SADC markets present scalable demand for standardized botanical extracts and evidence-based natural health products, with limited GMPaligned production facilities currently operating at scale.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 18.0pt;" align="left"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">International Export Potential: </strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Global demand for clean-label botanical extracts and clinically validated phytomedicines continues to expand. AGF&rsquo;s structured certification roadmap (e. g. ISO 9001, ISO 22000, GMP compliance) supports long-term access to regulated export markets.</p>',
