    'sous_titre' => 'INVEST IN US OR BECOME A CONTRACTUAL BROKER WITH US TODAY !?',
    'contenu_texte' => '<p><strong>With USD 40+ million as seed capital within the first five years vision (Vision 2026-2031), AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS (AGF) Limited is a vertically integrated agro-industrial Zambian privately-owned agro-industrial biotechnology enterprise steadily engaged in transforming commercial organic farming of target and selective medicinal plants, functional crops, fruits and nutrient-dense agricultural resources into standardized plant-based TCAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements, clean-label fortified health food products and beverages completely free from added unsafe sugar and chemicals, High-nutrient organic fertilizers as well as scientifically advanced formulation of phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals subjected to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility, as well as clean-label fortified health food products and fruit beverages. By integrating climate-smart commercial organic farming, structured out-grower networks, laboratory-driven product profiling, standardization preclinical &amp; clinical trials, and scalable processing infrastructure, AGF shifts agriculture from low-margin primary commodity production to high-value industrial farming and manufacturing. The company is building a growth platform designed to expand cultivated acreage, increase processing capability, strengthen regional export penetration, and generate sustainable employment, especially of youth and women while contributing to Zambia&rsquo;s economic transformation and natural health value chain development.</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>We are targeting multi-million-dollar annual turnover, sustainable EBITDA performance, and scalable export expansion by 2031 (Vision 2026-2031).</p>
<p><strong>In short:</strong></p>
<p><strong>AGF&rsquo;s facility (AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES) is engaged in manufacturing the following standard and GMP-compliant key products:</strong></p>
<p>A) CAMs (Traditional, Complementary and Alternative Medicines), targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>
<p>B) Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>
<p>C) Clean-label Fortified Health Food Products &amp; Beverages for prevention and fight against malnutrition especially among children, pregnant women breast feeding mothers;</p>
<p>D) High-nutrient organic fertilizers for soil regeneration and enrichment;</p>
<p>E) Phytomedicines, targeting acute and chronic diseases;</p>
<p>F) Phytopharmaceuticals, targeting acute and chronic diseases.</p>
