<li><strong><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">Strategic Positioning:</span><em> </em></span><em><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: black;">AFRICAN GREEN FARMERS LIMITED is positioned as a vertically integrated agro-industrial company focused on high-value medicinal and functional crops. Through structured partnerships, value addition and export-oriented processing, the company transforms commercial organic agriculture into scalable industrial (TCAMs, Nutraceuticals/Food Supplements, phytomedicines and phytopharmaceuticals subjected to preclinical and clinical trials via our scientific research laboratory and laboratory animal breeding facility, as well as clean-label fortified health food products and fruit beverages.</span></em></strong></li>
</ul>',
