  array (
    'id_section' => 198,
    'id_page' => 2,
    'type_section' => 'texte',
    'titre_section' => '10. Specific Strategic Objectives (2026–2031)',
    'sous_titre' => '10. Specific Strategic Objectives (2026–2031)',
    'contenu_texte' => '<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">10. Specific Strategic Objectives (2026&ndash;2031)</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<h3 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">10.1. Commercial Organic Farming Expansion Objective</h3>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Scale climate-smart commercial organic cultivation of high-value medicinal and functional crops.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Phase I (2026&ndash;2027)</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Operationalize 90 hectares already acquired.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 51.5pt .85pt 18.5pt;"><span style="font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;">&uuml;</span><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Cultivate priority medicinal plants including Carica papayaya and aloe vera <span style="font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;">&uuml;</span><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Establish irrigation, post-harvest handling, and drying systems.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Phase II (2028&ndash;2031)</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Expand to 2,000+ hectares (owned + contracted farming).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Integrate 5,000+ out-growers.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.0pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Achieve certified organic compliance (regional/international standards).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Implement digital traceability across &ge;70% of cultivated area. <span style="font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;">&sect;</span><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Target Output by 2031:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>15,000&ndash;25,000 metric tons annual raw biomass production.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h3 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">10.2. Advanced Processing &amp; Manufacturing Infrastructure Objective<span style="font-weight: normal;"> </span></h3>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Deploy USD 40+ million seed capital into advanced agro-biotechnology infrastructure.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Capital Allocation Areas:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">A. Facility Establishment</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Investment in:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">1)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction of GMP-grade facility (multi-zone design)<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span>and commissioning.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">2)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ISO-classified cleanroom establishment essentially for:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -14.4pt; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Post-harvest processing, extraction, concentration, chromatographic purification and drying of plant-based bioactive compounds</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -14.4pt; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Encapsulation and tableting</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -14.4pt; mso-list: l7 level2 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Bottling, bottle sealing and labeling, profiling and standardization, cartooning and case packaging</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">B, Manufacturing Line Systems</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="color: red;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Investment in:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 18.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">1)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->A fully integrated and automated Turnkey Ultrasound-Assisted Extraction (UAE), Capsule Production, Tableting and packaging Line System customized to manufacture:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l5 level2 lfo3; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 30.15pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:group
