</v:shape><span style=\'mso-element:field-end\'></span><![endif]--><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Regional and international market credibility. <span style="color: red;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">10.3. Product Portfolio Development Objective</strong> By 2031, commercialize:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">A. Standardized TCAMAs</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">TCAMAs (Traditional Complementary &amp; Alternative Medicine Adaptations), 20+ standardized botanical formulations, Stability-tested and batch-traceable.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: -17.05pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 17.05pt;" align="left"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">B.<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Nutraceuticals &amp; Food Supplements </strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">15+ evidence-supported supplements, Clean-label, non-synthetic fortified products.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: -17.05pt; line-height: 107%; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt 17.05pt;" align="left"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">C.<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';">&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Fortified Functional Foods &amp; Beverages </strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Nutrient-dense fruit &amp; vegetable derivatives, Botanical-enhanced health beverages.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">D. Clinical Trial&ndash;Based Phytomedicines &amp; Phytopharmaceuticals</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Pre-clinical validation via animal research facility, at least 3 clinical trial programs initiated by 2030.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Target acute and chronic conditions (metabolic, inflammatory, immune-related).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">10.4. Quality, GMP &amp; ISO Certification Objective</strong> By 2029:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Achieve ISO 9001 certification.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Achieve ISO 22000 certification.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Implement full GMP documentation &amp; SOP system.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Establish pharmacovigilance and post-market surveillance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Secure regulatory approvals for domestic commercialization.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Prepare export dossiers for regional markets (COMESA/SADC).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">This ensures readiness for international pharmaceutical-grade market entry.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .15pt -.25pt;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">10.5. Financial &amp; Market Performance Objective</strong> By 2031:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Annual turnover: USD 15&ndash;25 million</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Gross margin &ge; 45%</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->EBITDA &ge; 22%</p>
