<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Export share &ge; 30% of total revenue.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<h3 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">10.6. Socio-Economic &amp; ESG Impact Objective</h3>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->500+ direct skilled industrial jobs.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->5,000&ndash;10,000 indirect rural livelihoods.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm 2.3pt 36.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&uuml;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->&ge;60% youth and women participation. <span style="font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;">&uuml;</span><span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>30&ndash;50% farmer income increase.</p>
