<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Advanced Lab Equipment: 15&ndash;20%</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Processing &amp; Manufacturing Lines: 20&ndash;30%</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Cleanrooms &amp; Sterile Zones: 8&ndash;12%</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Certification &amp; Regulatory Compliance: 3&ndash;5%</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level2 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Working Capital Buffer:10&ndash;15%</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">This level of capitalization positions AGF not as a small herbal company- but as a regional agro-biotechnology and phytopharmaceutical industrial platform.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strategic Positioning Shift</p>
