</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><strong>Clinical Trials &amp; Healthcare Networks:</strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Conduct human studies to demonstrate safety and efficacy.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Lusaka hospitals and NCD clinics &ndash; patient recruitment and clinical monitoring.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left">Regional: Regional referral hospitals &ndash; coordination and management of clinical studies. International: MD Anderson Cancer Center, Mayo Clinic &ndash; oncology and metabolic trial collaboration, statistical analysis, and GCP compliance.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><strong>Regulatory &amp; Market Authorization:</strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Ensure compliance with domestic and international standards.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Domestic: </strong>Zambia Medicines Regulatory Authority &ndash; product registration and pharmacovigilance guidance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Regional:</strong> COMESA regulatory authorities &ndash; regional alignment and compliance support. International: World Health Organization &ndash; guidance on traditional medicine integration and global NCD frameworks.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><strong>Manufacturing &amp; Quality Assurance:</strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left">Purpose: Industrial-scale production under internationally recognized GMP standards. Domestic: Local GMP consultants &ndash; facility audits, process validation, and quality management.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left">Regional: Regional certification firms &ndash; batch standardization and quality assurance. International: SGS, Bureau Veritas, T&Uuml;V Rheinland &ndash; GMP certification, process validation, and export compliance.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><strong>Safety &amp; Preclinical Testing:</strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Confirm regulatory-grade safety of products before human trials.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Local preclinical labs &ndash; initial toxicity and safety screening.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Regional:</strong> Regional GLP labs &ndash; organ toxicity and chronic exposure studies.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left">International: Charles River Laboratories, Evotec &ndash; GLP-compliant toxicology, pharmacokinetics, and IND-enabling studies.</p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><strong>Financial &amp; Development Partners:</strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide funding, ESG guidance, and impact measurement.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Domestic:</strong> Bank of Zambia, local DFIs &ndash; seed funding and ESG advisory.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong>Regional:</strong> African Development Bank &ndash; capital mobilization, ESG frameworks, and blended finance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left">International: International Finance Corporation, Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation &ndash; impact funding, blended finance structuring, and global donor alignment.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left">Conclusion</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<p class="conclusion">&nbsp;</p>',
