    'sous_titre' => ' (Building Trust Through Transparency, Accountability, and Strategic Growth)',
    'contenu_texte' => '<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;"><strong><span style="line-height: 103%; color: black;">Our Commitment to Investors, Donors &amp; Financial Brokers&nbsp;</span></strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">&nbsp; &nbsp;At AGF, we are dedicated to maximizing impact while ensuring financial integrity. Our approach combines:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Non-fund Diversion Policy: Legally binding restricted use of proceeds covenant</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Transparency: Clear reporting of funds, expenditures, and project outcomes</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Accountability: Governance structures and audit-ready processes</span></p>
</li>
<li><span style="font-size: 24pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif; color: black;"><strong>Financial Governance and Oversight&nbsp;</strong></span>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">AGF adheres to international best practices in financial management, including:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Independent audits and financial reviews</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Robust internal controls to safeguard assets</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Board-level oversight of all financial decisions</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Compliance with local and international regulations and reporting standards</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investors and donors can trust that funds are managed efficiently, ethically, and in full compliance</span>.</span></p>
</li>
<li><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;"><strong><span style="line-height: 103%; color: black;">Investment Opportunities </span></strong></span><br>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">AGF offers strategically structured investment opportunities designed to generate measurable returns while supporting health, nutrition, sustainable economic development and sustainable agriculture initiatives:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Seed and growth-stage funding for AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES and digital platforms</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Co-investment opportunities with regional and international partners</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->ESG-aligned projects focusing on preventive nutrition, functional foods, and organic farming of target medicinal plants, functional nutrient-dense crops, fruits and vegetables serving as raw materials for our manufacturing facility</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investments are linked to clear KPIs and market expansion metrics, ensuring measurable impact and visibility.</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;"><span style="font-size: 24pt; font-family: \'arial black\', sans-serif;"><strong>Donor Engagement and Impact</strong></span></h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">Donors are a critical part of AGF&rsquo;s mission. We provide:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Regular impact reports highlighting social, environmental, and health outcomes</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 9.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-language-override: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal;"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Transparent tracking of funds toward community programs, research, and digital outreach</span></p>
