    'contenu_texte' => '<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
<div class="card h-100">
<div class="card-body">
<h4 class="card-title">A.<span style="font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">Investing in Facility Construction &amp; Industrial Infrastructure </span></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Construction of the AGF-PHYTOMED INDUSTRIES processing facility</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Pre-built GMP cleanrooms for critical processing zones</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->HVAC systems with controlled pressure gradients</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Clean steam and purified water systems</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste management and solvent recovery systems</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Hybrid power systems (solar + backup generation)</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Fire suppression and safety compliance systems</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Stuff Residential Units</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
<div class="card h-100">
<div class="card-body">
<h4 class="card-title">B. <span style="font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">Investing in Processing &amp; Production Equipment </span></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">A fully automated and integrated high-throughput<em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;"> </em>Turnkey <em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal;">Ultrasound-Assisted Extraction (UAE) Line System</em> integrating (In a single line system) essentially post-harvest processing of plant raw materials, validated solvent-based extraction, concentration, chromatographic purification, vacuum drying, micronization and ultrasonic vibratory sieving, anti-cracking agent aseptic incorporation, capsule and tablet production, bottle filling, capping and sealing, cartooning, instructional labeling and leaflet inserting, post-packaging High Pressure Processing (HPP) Optimization (Non-thermal sterilization) and case packaging.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">This is a GMP-Compliant manufacturing efficiency within a single continuous end-to-end line system, approximately 60m x 5m in size. The line system manufactures any target extracts from any medicinal plants based on our need. This is the only processing line system to be secured using the seed capital.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">The rest of manufacturing line systems such as the Soybean Product (Fortified Liquid Soymilk, Soymilk Powder and Vacuum-dried Tofu) Integrated Manufacturing Line System, Spirulina Algae Supplement Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, Fruit Juice Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System, and Organic Fertilizer Integrated Turnkey Processing Line System will be secured and utilized using the facility&rsquo;s income-generating activities, mainly sales.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
<div class="card h-100">
<div class="card-body">
<h4 class="card-title">C. <span style="font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">Investing in Laboratory &amp; Quality Control Infrastructure </span></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 12.8pt;">Analytical laboratory and scientific research laboratory equipment, including UHPLCMS/MS, GC-MS/MS 8000,<strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-size: 22.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; color: red;"> </span></strong>HPAAS, AH SN600 Laser Scanning Microscope, RT-qPCR and High-Parameter Digital Flow Cytometer for:<span style="color: red;"> </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">1)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Microbiology laboratory </strong>for testing microorganisms and biological contamination of raw materials and finished products</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">2)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Analytical laboratory (QC Lab)</strong> that performs testing for product profiling and standardization</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">3)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Preclinical <span style="mso-tab-count: 1;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>laboratory</strong> <span style="mso-tab-count: 1;"> </span>performing <span style="mso-tab-count: 1;"> </span>product <span style="mso-tab-count: 1;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>toxicology, <span style="mso-tab-count: 1;"> </span>safety, <span style="mso-tab-count: 1;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>and pharmacokinetics</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">4)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">GLP </strong>(Good Laboratory Practice) <strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">laboratory </strong>that generates non-clinical data before human trials</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.45pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 45.05pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">5)<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Clinical research laboratory</strong> that analyses clinical study samples</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6 mb-4">
<div class="card h-100">
<div class="card-body">
<h4 class="card-title">D. <span style="font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: black; mso-ansi-language: FR; mso-fareast-language: FR; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">Investing in Regulatory, Licensing &amp; Certification </span></h4>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<ul>
<li>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Regulatory and licensing in which the seed capital will be utilized include the following:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Business Application &amp; Registration &ndash;PACRA</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Investment Licence- ZDA</p>
