<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Screening EPB Report Certificate- ZEMA</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Waste Management Licence- ZEMA</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Site Approval Certificate- ZMRA</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Product Registration- ZMRA</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->GMP Inspection- ZAMRA</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.55pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 13.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Manufacturing Licence- ZAMRA</p>
