    'contenu_texte' => '<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">1)<span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Strategic Overview</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .8pt 0cm;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">AGF&rsquo;s Digital Growth &amp; Market Expansion Platform centralizes all strategic digital marketing channels, including existing and ever expanding educational WhatsApp groups, Telegram, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, email, and website&mdash;into a single coordinated system using HubSpot Marketing Hub. Integrated with ChatGPT AI, this platform automates daily content, advertisements, and community engagement, ensuring scalable, measurable, and professional market expansion.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Investor Advantage: Transparent KPIs, real-time analytics, and predictable growth across domestic, regional, and international markets.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">2)<span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>Community &amp; Expert Engagement</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">235+ WhatsApp groups, 211,500+ participants, expanding daily</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Key Partner: NUFOTEC BURUNDI (EAC)</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Expert-Led Content: Registered nutritionists, dieticians, and medical professionals provide daily guidance on presentational advices and guidance on:</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Acute diseases: e. g. cough, diarrhea, respiratory infections</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Chronic conditions: cancer, diabetes, cardiovascular disease, obesity, child malnutrition</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preventive nutrition, home remedies, and organic farming</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -13.6pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 31.6pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&sect;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Communities act as active marketing and educational channels, converting engagement into product adoption and economic development.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
<h2 style="margin-left: -.25pt;">3)<span style="font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;"> </span>ChatGPT AI Services</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%; margin: 0cm 0cm .3pt 0cm;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Role:</strong> Drives all automated content and advertising across AGF&rsquo;s strategic digital marketing channel network<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Automated Daily Content:</strong> Health tips, preventive nutrition, product updates, and home remedies distributed across all our platforms</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Automated Advertisements: </strong>Targeted domestic, regional, and international campaigns</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;">Real-Time Community Interaction: 24/7 AI-powered assistance and feedback capture</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Analytics &amp; Reporting:</strong> Tracks engagement, adoption, and ESG impact via real-time dashboards</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt -.25pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Impact:</strong> ChatGPT ensures continuous, coordinated, and measurable outreach, transforming communities into active market channels.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0cm; line-height: 107%;" align="left"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>
