<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 0cm .85pt 22.55pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 103%; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">&Oslash;<span style="font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->AI-optimized content for cross-border engagement</p>
